{
  "source": "Prompts/context-matters-2.mp4",
  "duration": 70.449375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.92,
      "text": "Look at the left side of this infographic."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.74,
      "end": 4.92,
      "text": "Just because you have an assignment open on your screen,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.3,
      "end": 7.26,
      "text": "doesn't mean your AI assistant can see it."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.64,
      "end": 10.24,
      "text": "To get information inside the AI's window,"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.56,
      "end": 13.52,
      "text": "manually share the relevant material directly in the chat,"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.94,
      "end": 15.72,
      "text": "or use the app's built-in upload tools."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.28,
      "end": 18.5,
      "text": "The same boundary applies to past interactions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.16,
      "end": 20.06,
      "text": "moving to the right panel."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.64,
      "end": 22.88,
      "text": "Never assume the AI accesses everything"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.88,
      "end": 25.0,
      "text": "discussed in an older, separate chat."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.92,
      "end": 27.98,
      "text": "Built-in memory or project folders can bring"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.98,
      "end": 29.12,
      "text": "past information forward."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.64,
      "end": 31.18,
      "text": "But to prevent fragmented context,"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.8,
      "end": 33.38,
      "text": "you must supply the missing details."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.36,
      "end": 36.16,
      "text": "That brings us to a simple rule of thumb"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.16,
      "end": 37.22,
      "text": "you can use every time."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.76,
      "end": 38.96,
      "text": "Look at the yellow bar at the bottom."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.5,
      "end": 42.02,
      "text": "Before you hit send on any prompt, stop and check."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.56,
      "end": 44.94,
      "text": "Does the AI actually have the information it needs?"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.78,
      "end": 47.42,
      "text": "Having your assignment open on your laptop"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.42,
      "end": 49.0,
      "text": "doesn't mean AI can use it."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.5,
      "end": 51.08,
      "text": "Share the relevant material in the chat,"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.38,
      "end": 53.24,
      "text": "or use the app's tools to make it available."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.14,
      "end": 56.92,
      "text": "And don't assume AI has everything you said in another chat."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.64,
      "end": 60.18,
      "text": "Memory and projects can bring information forward,"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.68,
      "end": 62.58,
      "text": "but you may still need to supply missing details."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.38,
      "end": 64.44,
      "text": "Before you ask, check."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.06,
      "end": 66.72,
      "text": "Does AI have the information it needs?"
    }
  ],
